# Agent / tooling working dirs (not part of the project)
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. These directories hold local agent state -- task
# trackers, session notes, tool config -- that is useful on one machine and has
# no business being published. `.beads/` in particular was protected only by
# .git/info/exclude, which is local to a single clone and travels with nothing,
# so a fresh checkout had no protection at all.
.agents/
.beads/
.claude/
.codex/
.omc/
